test.yaml:6:16: container image "node" has no tag, so the registry decides which image is pulled ("latest"). pin it to a digest like "node@sha256:{digest}" [unpinned-images]
test.yaml:12:14: container image "ghcr.io/owner/image:latest" uses the tag "latest", which changes whenever the registry is updated. pin it to a digest like "ghcr.io/owner/image@sha256:{digest}" [unpinned-images]
